                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "was an alright RPG. I liked the idea behind the story and the whole virtual-world setting, and there’s a fair amount of content to get through with different characters, quests and equipment to work towards.\r\n\r\nThe gameplay was decent, but the combat and grinding could get a little repetitive. I can appreciate what the game was trying to do, even if not everything worked perfectly for me.\r\n\r\nOverall, it was an okay experience. I didn't dislike it, but it wasn't a game that really blew me away either.",
